# No auto-launch of the game

Do **not** agent-initiate opening the game after edits or as a smoke test.

## Banned (unless the user explicitly asks to launch/open the game)

- MCP `browser_navigate` to the local game URL
- MCP `open_resource` to the dev URL
- Shell `open` / `xdg-open` (or similar) of the local game URL

## After a full edit pass

Tell the user the work is done and they can refresh. Prefer mentioning `http://127.0.0.1:5299/` when relevant. Do **not** open it for them.

## Allowed

Vite HMR / full-reload-on-src-change may stay enabled so an already-open tab updates. Do not remove that unless it is clearly wrong. The ban is only on **agent-initiated launching/opening** of the game.
